*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PEN0036
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-09-10 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-06 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 445
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0036.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> LATE PAYMENTS IN LAST 12 MONTHS
    05 LATE-CNT-12M       PIC 9(2).
    *> DAYS PAYMENT IS LATE
    05 DPD-DAYS           PIC 9(3).
    05 RUN-DATE           PIC 9(8).
    05 RUN-DATE-R REDEFINES RUN-DATE.
       10 RUN-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 RUN-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 RUN-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 ACCT-STAT-CD       PIC X VALUE 'A'.
    05 LATE-FEE           PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM SUSPEND-CHECK
    PERFORM REFER-COLLECTIONS
    DISPLAY "ACCT-STAT-CD=" ACCT-STAT-CD
    DISPLAY "LATE-FEE=" LATE-FEE
    STOP RUN.
SUSPEND-CHECK.
    IF LATE-CNT-12M >= 5
       AND DPD-DAYS > 45
        MOVE 'S' TO ACCT-STAT-CD
        ADD 50 TO LATE-FEE
    END-IF.
REFER-COLLECTIONS.
    IF DPD-DAYS > 60
        MOVE 'C' TO ACCT-STAT-CD
    END-IF.
